{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43263","headline":"风草不留霜 · 王景中","name":"风草不留霜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"繁霜当永夜，寒草正惊风。\n飘素衰苹末，流光晚蕙丛。\n悠扬方泛影，皎洁却飞空。\n不定离披际，难凝蘙荟中。\n低昂闲散质，肃杀想成功。\n独感玄晖咏，依依此夕同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王景中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}